  "description": "Buffalo E is designed to conquer trails and city streets alike, blending superior suspension technology with lightweight performance. The enhanced 27.5” alloy frame ensures durability while maintaining agility for off-road and urban adventures. Equipped with a 36V 15Ah Samsung battery, this e-mountain bike delivers a range of 40-50 miles on a single charge, making it perfect for extended rides without compromising power.\nThe front fork suspension with lock-out feature allows you to switch between smooth pavement rides and rugged trails effortlessly, providing optimal comfort and control. Enjoy the freedom to explore diverse terrains with Kenda 27.5” x 2.35 tires, offering excellent grip and stability on challenging surfaces.\nStay confident on your descents with the powerful hydraulic brake system, which ensures precise stopping power under any condition. Coupled with the ergonomic GEL sport saddle, Buffalo E is built for riders seeking a premium riding experience with maximum comfort and support.\nWith a top speed of 20 MPH, a net weight of 50 lbs, and a maximum weight capacity of 286 lbs, the Buffalo E is engineered to handle whatever the ride throws at you—whether it’s cruising the streets or tackling mountainous trails.\nExplore further, ride stronger, and experience the next level of e-mountain biking with the Buffalo E!",
